<title>USA: Tandy Corp Q4 loss after charges.</title>
<headline>Tandy Corp Q4 loss after charges.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.39   profit	 $1.39</p>
<p> Net loss		 137,672   profit	90,174</p>
<p> Revs		   2,050,796		2,087,468</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  58,211		   63,717</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.64   profit	 $3.12</p>
<p> Net loss		  91,571   profit     211,974</p>
<p> Revs		   8,285,488		5,839,087</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,832		   65,928</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Per share after preferred dividends of $1,544,000 vs $1,606,000 in qtr, and $6,319,000 vs $6,357,000 in year.</p>
<p>1996 losses include pretax restructuring provisions of $136.6 million in Q4 and $162.1 million in year, and charges for imparment of long-lived assets of $86.8 million in Q4 and $112.8 million in year.</p>
<p>1996 EPS before charges were $1.01 in Q4 and $2.20 in year.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 includes restructuring costs of $1.1 million.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
